00:03:06.290 --> 00:03:10.909
it burns really readily in an oxygen rich
atmosphere and reacts quite well with water

00:03:10.909 --> 00:03:14.489
in the atmosphere as well. So you have to
be very careful with yttrium because it oxidises

00:03:14.489 --> 00:03:16.909
and it is really quite easy to destroy.

00:03:16.909 --> 00:03:25.040
That’s Yttrium metal, just as turnings.
